cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PBE Pipeline: in-silico lncRNA-RBP interface mapping and disruptor nomination"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, open-source pipeline that maps the protein-binding element (PBE)
  on a disease long non-coding RNA from public data (CLIP footprints or a known RBP
  recognition motif) plus RNA secondary-structure prediction, and nominates ranked
  steric-block / decoy disruptor candidates. Part of the lncRNA-RBP scaffold-disruption
  platform submitted to the NIH TRDNT Challenge.
type: software
